# Composer design tokens

Global accent + typography presets live in **Sanity → Global Settings → Design tokens** (`globalSettings.designTokens`). Never hardcode brand orange in composer surfaces.

## Data flow

1. `fetchDesignTokens()` — `sanityFetch`, singleton `_id == "globalSettings"`, React `cache()`, draft-aware.
2. `resolveDesignTokenCssVars()` — maps presets → `--softree-accent`, `--softree-accent-soft`, `--softree-accent-tint`, `--softree-accent-border`, `--softree-heading-scale`, `--cs-accent`.
3. Root `layout.tsx` injects vars on `<html>`.
4. Composer shells use `mergeComposerStyleVars(designTokens)` from `@/lib/composer-style-vars`.

## Styling rules

```tsx
// ❌ BAD — bypasses Global Settings
className="text-[#FF7A2F]"
style={{ color: "#FF7A2F" }}

// ✅ GOOD
className="text-[var(--softree-accent,#FF7A2F)]"
style={{ backgroundColor: "var(--softree-accent-soft)" }}

// ✅ GOOD — tints / glows
className="bg-[radial-gradient(circle,color-mix(in_srgb,var(--softree-accent,#FF7A2F)_8%,transparent)_0%,transparent_68%)]"
```

- Default fallback hex: `DEFAULT_ACCENT` from `@/lib/brand-defaults` (not scattered `#FF7A2F`).
- Category listing pages (`CaseStudyGrid`, `categoryConfig`) may keep per-category accents — that is intentional, not composer tokens.

## Layout wiring

| Layout | Must pass `designTokens` |
|--------|--------------------------|
| `PageComposerLayout` | yes |
| `ManufacturingPowerPlatformLayout` / `ManufacturingCaseStudyPage` | yes |
| `BlogComposerLayout` | yes |
| Premium one-off layouts (parallax, bento, etc.) | inherit from `<html>` vars where possible |

## Publish & revalidate

- Editors must **Publish Global Settings** for live site (draft preview uses `sanityFetch` + draft mode).
- Webhook revalidates `/`, `/blog`, `/case-studies`, and root layout on `globalSettings` change.

## Pre-ship checklist

1. Change accent to **Ocean blue** in Global Settings → Publish → hard refresh case study + blog composer page.
2. Metrics, CTAs, links, hero glow, gallery ring all reflect new accent.
3. Manufacturing layout and page-composer both update (not just one).
4. Grep changed files: no new `#FF7A2F` / `rgba(255,122,47` in composer/blog components unless inside `var(..., fallback)`.
5. Studio live preview iframe (draft enter URL) shows draft token changes without publish.
